 studs\",\"A conservative 7-flag Android preset; desktop, network, physics, and material overrides are excluded.\",\"A fighting-style purchase is already running.\",\"A preset can contain flags your client or executor does not support. Check the final applied/failed count, remove the problem entries if known, and avoid repeatedly applying the same broken pack.\",\"A preset is already being applied.\",\"A race reroll request is already in progress.\",\"A random fruit was rolled successfully.\",\"A reset request is already in progress.\",\"A simple guide to loading, checking, and safely applying client flags.\",\"ABILITY RANGE CHECK\",\"Ability Reach Check\",\"ACCENT\",\"ACCENTH\",\"ACCESS KEY\",\"ACTIONS\",\"Activates aimed Soru\",\"Activates V4 when the meter is full and you are free to transform\",\"ACTIVE FEATURES\",\"Active Smart Macro slot copied.\",\"Active Smart Macro slot updated.\",\"Add\",\"Add these options only after the basic block sequence works.\",\"Adds a controllable movement burst when Skull Guitar M1 is used\",\"Adds a movement boost when you use Sanguine Art Z\",\"Adds a second choice to the same block. If the main skill is on cooldown, Smart tries the backup. If neither is ready, it skips that block.\",\"Adds a small adjustment for your ping to the number you choose below\",\"Adds extra movement in the direction Diamond's basic attack sends you\",\"Adds extra player details. Choose which details to show below.\",\"Adds extra speed while you move\",\"Adds values such as Dash Boost length and Speed Multiplier\",\"Adjust a color with its Red, Green, and Blue sliders. Your changes are saved automatically.\",\"Advanced\",\"Advanced executor-dependent Roblox client settings.\",\"AFTER BLOCK 1\",\"AIM\",\"Aim \194\183 Skill Aim\",\"Aim \194\183 Soru / Flash Step\",\"AIM & COMBAT\",\"Aim Distance (studs)\",\"Aim Exclude\",\"Aim Normal Soru\",\"Aim Prediction\",\"Aimbot\",\"Aimbot and camlock skip excluded players. You can still attack them manually.\",\"AIMBOT, CAMLOCK, AND RANGE\",\"AIRJUMP\",\"All buttons were reset to their default positions and turned off.\",\"All keybinds were restored to default.\",\"Also expand NPC hitboxes; off by default to avoid oversized Instinct outlines\",\"Another race request is already in progress.\",\"Another travel action is already running.\",\"Anti AFK\",\"Anti Combo\",\"ANTI COMBO\",\"Appearance\",\"Applied %d flag%s. Rejoin or restart if the preset requires it.\",\"Applied %d flags. Rejoin if the preset requires it.\",\"Applied %d of %d flags; %d failed.\",\"Applied %d of %d flags. %d were unsupported or invalid.\",\"Apply FFlags\",\"Applying FFlags... %d/%d\",\"Arcade\",\"ATTACK\",\"Attack Delay\",\"ATTACKS\",\"Attempts to escape when your health drops below the value below\",\"AUTO\",\"Auto Buso\",\"Auto Buy Melee\",\"Auto Buy Melee cancelled.\",\"Auto Fast Mode\",\"Auto Observation\",\"Auto Prediction\",\"Auto Roll Fruits\",\"Auto roll is off. Checking the gacha cooldown.\",\"Auto Roll spends money automatically while enabled. It does not ask before each roll.\",\"Auto Skull Guitar\",\"Auto Skull Guitar only fires while Skull Guitar is already equipped\",\"Auto V3\",\"Auto V3 and Smart V3 were turned off.\",\"Auto V4\",\"Auto-Store Fruit\",\"Auto-Store Rolled Fruits\",\"AUTOMATIC TIMING\",\"Automatically activates your race V3 ability when available.\",\"Automatically enables the game's Fast Mode to reduce visual detail\",\"Automatically fires Skull Guitar M1 at your Skill Aimbot target\",\"Avatar changes reapplied.\",\"Avatar, font, and display settings reset.\",\"Avoid protected safe-zone players unless continuing an active fight.\",\"BACK TO MACRO\",\"Background Music\",\"Background Visibility\",\"Backspace to clear\",\"Backup Skill\",\"BACKUP SKILL\",\"Backup Skill runs only when the main skill is confirmed on cooldown.\\nJumps After Skill makes you jump after that skill, before continuing to the next block.\",\"BEFORE BLOCK 1\",\"BG\",\"Blox Fruits\",\"Blox Fruits Fast